# v0.9.1 Phase 8 Task 32 — Debug namespace from urbiscript.
#
# Debug.coros() from script and the NDJSON introspect op answer with the
# same bytes: both call urbi_introspect_coros.  The script one returns a
# String, which the eval path then hands over as a JSON string — so the
# inner quotes arrive escaped, and the stable thing to match is the key
# name itself.

## mode: repl

> {"id":15,"op":"eval","code":"Debug.coros()"}
< "id":15 | "kind":"result" | coros
< "id":15 | "kind":"done"
